// Demo persistence, for showing the CMS before the backend exists.
//
// TRUE  — the Application Builder and the Properties CMS save to this browser.
//         Nothing leaves the machine. Every screen says so in one line.
// FALSE — both go back to the real adapters: public JSON to read, an
//         authenticated POST to the site's Cloudflare Worker to write.
//
// This one line is the whole switch. Flip it when the worker is deployed; no
// component changes, because no component knows which side it is talking to.
export default true;
